{"about_the_game":"A short exploration game set in the abandoned offices of productivity analysis.<br><br>Discover its past, purpose, and secrets!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >// FEATURES //</h2><strong>INVESTIGATE ANOMALIES:</strong><br>An abandoned productivity facility still hums with power. Your task is to inspect and contain the remaining \u201canomalies\u201d - strange rooms that defy logic and design. Each anomaly has its own visual theme and behavior, forming a self-contained mystery to uncover.<br><br><strong>CORPORATE HORROR:</strong><br>A sterile, corporate setting slowly breaks apart into something surreal. Discover fragments of the facility\u2019s purpose and the story of the AI that once ran it - and may still be trying to. Lights flicker, hallways shift, and the environment reflects your descent into its memory.<br><br><strong>ENDLESS 9-5 PRODUCTIVITY LOOP:</strong><br>Each shift begins in the central lobby. Select three anomalies to investigate, explore the facility to locate them, archive their data at the workstation, and return before \u201cEnd of Day.\u201d Progressively, the systems degrade - and so does your sense of what\u2019s real.<br><br><strong>LIMINAL WALKING SIM:</strong><br>Minimal UI, procedure posters, PA announcements, and 80s-era tutorial videos guide you through your \u201cduties.\u201d But the deeper you go, the more the simulation breaks down.<br><br><strong>A SHORT, IMMERSIVE EXPERIENCE:</strong><br>Built for fans of Backrooms, Pools, and Severance, The Office Rooms offers a 1-2 hour narrative experience that blends liminal exploration, subtle horror, and corporate absurdity.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Burnout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1925940/4bf7f95033b1cebbe289d35679df2285e5a3b2f5.jpg"},{"name":"Sandbox","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1925940/d750ce8cc0f1d3849b5c8d77320ed3152a71afc5.jpg"},{"name":"Elevator Pitch","path":"ht